    <string name="setup_help_title">One-time TV setup</string>
    <string name="setup_help">1. On the TV: Settings → All Settings → General → External Devices → TV On With Mobile, and turn on “Turn on via Wi-Fi”.\n\n2. Keep the phone and TV on the same Wi-Fi network.\n\n3. The first time you connect, the TV shows a one-time PIN. Enter it here — no TV remote needed. The pairing is remembered.\n\nOnly the local network is used. The app never sends your TV details anywhere.</string>

